    "body": "Claim released by the main session: round 1 is not proven (see the agent's final comment). Work-in-progress saved outside the repo; the next attempt resumes from these steps: (1) Helix entry on the fixture + load measured from a stock top above the level (the plunge bore reads 76.8 % D at the entry); (2) pin the OffsetRings digest from a dd8bc95 build (byte-identical rings); (3) a longer D-flat bar so the seam case reaches the seam check; (4) move the ~10 min debug test to the heavy lane; (5) the acceptance gates. Nothing landed on main.",
